# .env.local — LOCAL-DEV OVERRIDES
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (which is gitignored) and edit the values
# you want to override for local testing. Astro precedence: .env.local
# beats .env, so anything set here wins.
#
# To go back to prod: rename or delete .env.local. .env's prod values
# take effect on the next `pnpm dev` restart.
#
# Common local-dev overrides:

# Point at a local voxivium-mvp API server (docker or `go run ./cmd/api`).
# PUBLIC_VOXIVIUM_API_BASE="http://localhost:8080"

# Or, if you're tunneling your local server through ngrok:
# PUBLIC_VOXIVIUM_API_BASE="https://your-ngrok-hostname.ngrok-free.dev"

# Any other PUBLIC_* var from .env can be overridden the same way.
